findings.recommendation:
Add `subtle = "2"` to `mcp/Cargo.toml` (it is already transitively present via hmac/sha2). Replace the hand-rolled function:
```rust
use subtle::ConstantTimeEq;
fn ct_eq(a: &[u8], b: &[u8]) -> bool {
    a.ct_eq(b).into()
}
```
Delete the `constant_time_eq` function. This is a one-line change per call site.

Replace the misleading sentence with the accurate semantics:
```
// For anonymous callers, `owner_pubkey` is the server keypair (the
// fallback from the dispatcher when claims are absent). This means
// anonymous recall returns only public rows anchored by the server keypair —
// it does NOT cross tenant boundaries. Cross-tenant anonymous recall
// (returning all public rows from all owners) is not implemented in v1.
```
